    "content": "IF there is something to this theory, that the stealer has known about the low entropy CC bug for years, and just waited for victims to accumulate before stealing…\n\nIF that is true, what caused them to strike now?\n\nCould this job vacancy posted by Coldcard just three weeks before the attack started be connected?\n\n“Own embedded firmware delivery”\n\n“Debug across firmware, hardware, tooling”\n\nConnected or not, it is very likely that the bug would have been discovered when this position got filled.",
